  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "The Daylight Front Desk",
    "overview": "A clean, confident gym-software landing: navy and orange colour fields at page scale, light content sections, big Bricolage type and plain edge-to-edge photographs. The category standard played straight, at the craft level of Glofox, Mindbody, Wodify, Paystack and Flutterwave.",
