      "Page-scale colour fields: navy hero, orange stats, navy features, orange app band, navy close",
      "One accent: orange as a fill, bright on navy, darker values for text on light grounds",
      "Big tight display type over calm body text",
      "Plain edge-to-edge photographs with no scrim and no text on them",
      "Static by default with one authored scanner moment"
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Orange Is A Fill",
        "body": "#E0971F is 2.44:1 on white. Use it as a fill with navy text; use #9A5200 for small orange text and #BA6500 only for large display text.",
